恐效燕王論死，乃自殺。有司以聞。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m025-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"主父","kind":"person","person_id":"vbr_ff1_yc4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m025-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"4lf_9lg_slx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m025-0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"a05_brz_8xe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m025-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"主父","kind":"person","person_id":"vbr_ff1_yc4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m025-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"昆弟","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m025-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"昆弟","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m025-0088","start":88,"end":89,"surface":"偃","kind":"person","person_id":"vbr_ff1_yc4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m025-0097","start":97,"end":98,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"4lf_9lg_slx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m025-0099","start":99,"end":100,"surface":"姊","kind":"person","person_id":"hb2_xk3_z67","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m025-0103","start":103,"end":104,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"4lf_9lg_slx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m025-0105","start":105,"end":106,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"4lf_9lg_slx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m025-0116","start":116,"end":118,"surface":"燕王","kind":"person","person_id":"mm9_vf1_7o8","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin","book_id":"b-shiji-112","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji112-pingjin"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:p026","text":"主父始為布衣時，嘗游燕、趙，及其貴，發燕事。趙王恐其為國患，欲上書言其陰事，為偃居中，不敢發。及為齊相，出關，即使人上書，告言主父偃受諸侯金，以故諸侯子弟多以得封者。及齊王自殺，上聞大怒，以為主父劫其王令自殺，乃徵下吏治。主父服受諸侯金，實不劫王令自殺。上欲勿誅，是時公孫弘為御史大夫，乃言曰：「齊王自殺無後，國除為郡，入漢，主父偃本首惡，陛下不誅主父偃，無以謝天下。」乃遂族主父偃。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m026-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"主父","kind":"person","person_id":"vbr_ff1_yc4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m026-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"趙王","kind":"person","person_id":"40o_6pe_hvm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m026-0039","start":39,"end":40,"surface":"偃","kind":"person","person_id":"vbr_ff1_yc4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m026-0063","start":63,"end":66,"surface":"主父偃","kind":"person","person_id":"vbr_ff1_yc4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m026-0084","start":84,"end":86,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"4lf_9lg_slx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m026-0089","start":89,"end":90,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"a05_brz_8xe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m026-0096","start":96,"end":98,"surface":"主父","kind":"person","person_id":"vbr_ff1_yc4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m026-0099","start":99,"end":101,"surface":"其王","kind":"person","person_id":"4lf_9lg_slx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m026-0111","start":111,"end":113,"surface":"主父","kind":"person","person_id":"vbr_ff1_yc4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m026-0127","start":127,"end":128,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"a05_brz_8xe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m026-0134","start":134,"end":137,"surface":"公孫弘","kind":"person","person_id":"q69_35n_f3h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m026-0148","start":148,"end":150